<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom plans cost cutting-initiatives.</title>
<headline>Telecom plans cost cutting-initiatives.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Tuesday it was planning new cost cutting initiatives for the 1997/8 financial year.</p>
<p>The company also said it expected a substantial decline in the rate of cost increases over that year.</p>
